# =============================================================================
# Root .gitattributes for the oikos monorepo (oikos-api, oikos-mobile, oikos-web).
#
# Single source of truth: per-project refinements (Maven wrapper launcher,
# web asset binaries, ...) live here too instead of being duplicated in each
# sub-project's own .gitattributes.
# =============================================================================

# Normalize line endings to LF for text files, regardless of the OS
# checking them out (avoids noisy diffs between macOS/Linux/Windows).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-specific scripts must keep CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Shell scripts always LF, even when checked out on Windows.
*.sh text eol=lf

# oikos-api: Maven wrapper launcher - the Unix script needs LF, the Windows
# one needs CRLF (overrides the *.cmd rule above for this specific file).
/oikos-api/mvnw text eol=lf
/oikos-api/mvnw.cmd text eol=crlf

# oikos-web: SVGs are text but must keep LF, not be treated as binary.
*.svg text eol=lf

# Common binary types: never diff/convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.war binary
*.class binary
